$I \in [0, 1]$ Degree of compliance with open specifications Measured against LNIS, BPv7, CCSDS conformance requirements
$G \in [0, 1]$ Governance interoperability across shared functions $G_{\text{network}} = \min_{p} \min_{F} G_F(p)$; see Section 8.3 and Section 9.3
$E \in [0, 1]$ Resilience: fraction of critical services preserved when the largest provider is removed Network availability under failure metric (Section 14.2)
